// Secrets.xcconfig.template — copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (same
// directory) and paste your tokens to run a KEYED local build of the
// SceneViewDemo app. `Secrets.xcconfig` is gitignored (`**/Secrets.xcconfig`)
// and must NEVER be committed.
//
//     cp samples/ios-demo/SceneViewDemo/Secrets.xcconfig.template \
//        samples/ios-demo/SceneViewDemo/Secrets.xcconfig
//     # then edit Secrets.xcconfig and paste the token after the `=`
//
// Grab a Sketchfab token at: Sketchfab → Settings → Password & API → API Token.
//
// Leaving the value EMPTY (as below) is a valid keyless build: the Explore /
// Sketchfab carousels + search are simply disabled (SketchfabConfig.apiKey is
// nil) and demos render their bundled fallbacks. See `Config.xcconfig` for how
// the value flows into `Info.plist` (SketchfabAPIKey = $(SKETCHFAB_API_KEY)).

SKETCHFAB_API_KEY =
